---
title: Getting started
pageSlug: getting-started
mod: adventure-engine
section: getting-started
order: 1
---

Walk onto a structure the pack cares about. A plaque shows up with an offer.

**Y** accepts. You have to be **on** the building. Standing in the grass beside a desert temple does nothing except let you read the preview. **H** walks away. Hold **G** if the text is tiny.

Creative mode draws the box so you can see the bounds. That is for authors. Survival players just have to get their feet on the structure.

Ranks roll when the offer first appears: Scout, Adventurer, Veteran, Champion, Legend. Higher rank means a longer timer, meaner mobs, better loot. For find and sacrifice jobs it also changes which item is in play. Pay is a loot table plus vanilla XP.

If you wander off without accepting, the site goes quiet for a bit. Come back later and it will offer again.

First time it clicks: you crest a hill, see a pillager outpost, walk onto the platform, hit Y, and the place is suddenly a job. Kill the leader, grab the chest, get out before the timer.
